tion, view, tower, and seller expectations.\",\"category\":\"project_page\",\"order\":3,\"showOnHomepage\":false,\"homepageDisplayOrder\":0},{\"question\":\"Which configurations are available in Raj Residency?\",\"answer\":\"Raj Residency in Rajarajeshwari Nagar currently offers multiple configurations homes. Configuration mix can change over time, so serious buyers should review the latest active inventory before planning site visits.\",\"category\":\"project_page\",\"order\":4,\"showOnHomepage\":false,\"homepageDisplayOrder\":0},{\"question\":\"How big are the homes in Raj Residency?\",\"answer\":\"Available homes in Raj Residency span roughly multiple sq. ft.. Beyond size, it is worth comparing layout efficiency, natural light, balcony usability, and overall livability before shortlisting.\",\"category\":\"project_page\",\"order\":5,\"showOnHomepage\":false,\"homepageDisplayOrder\":0},{\"question\":\"Is Raj Residency ready to move or under construction?\",\"answer\":\"Raj Residency is currently listed as 19 Years. Even so, buyers should independently verify construction progress, approvals, handover readiness, and any phase-wise delivery nuances.\",\"category\":\"project_page\",\"order\":6,\"showOnHomepage\":false,\"homepageDisplayOrder\":0},{\"question\":\"How many homes are currently available in Raj Residency?\",\"answer\":\"We currently show 0 live options in Raj Residency. Availability can move quickly in established projects, especially for stronger layouts and more desirable positions within the development.\",\"category\":\"project_page\",\"order\":7,\"showOnHomepage\":false,\"homepageDisplayOrder\":0},{\"question\":\"Why should I consider buying a home in Raj Residency?\",\"answer\":\"Raj Residency merits consideration for its location in Rajarajeshwari Nagar, current inventory across multiple configurations, and pricing around on request. It can be especially relevant for buyers comparing established residential communities in this micro-market.\",\"category\":\"project_page\",\"order\":8,\"showOnHomepage\":false,\"homepageDisplayOrder\":0},{\"question\":\"Is Raj Residency a good option for families buying in Rajarajeshwari Nagar?\",\"answer\":\"For families evaluating Rajarajeshwari Nagar, Raj Residency can be compelling depending on its internal layout quality, amenity mix, neighbourhood connectivity, and how comfortably it fits your budget and lifestyle priorities.\",\"category\":\"project_page\",\"order\":9,\"showOnHomepage\":false,\"homepageDisplayOrder\":0},{\"question\":\"What should I verify before buying in Raj Residency?\",\"answer\":\"Before buying in Raj Residency, verify approvals, exact unit specifications, project maintenance structure, payment schedule, possession readiness, and the on-ground quality of common areas and amenities.\",\"category\":\"project_page\",\"order\":10,\"showOnHomepage\":false,\"homepageDisplayOrder\":0},{\"question\":\"Does Settlin assist buyers interested in Raj Residency?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. If you are evaluating Raj Residency, Settlin can support you with inventory discovery, site visit coordination, legal-document guidance, price discussions, and end-to-end assistance through closure.\",\"category\":\"project_page\",\"order\":12,\"showOnHomepage\":false,\"homepageDisplayOrder\":0},{\"question\":\"Can Settlin help with legal verification and home loans for homes in Raj Residency?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. For buyers considering homes in Raj Residency, Settlin can help coordinate legal verification, documentation support, and home-loan assistance so you can move ahead with more confidence.\",\"category\":\"project_page\",\"order\":13,\"showOnHomepage\":false,\"homepageDisplayOrder\":0},{\"question\":\"How is buying in Raj Residency with Settlin different from browsing listings on your own?\",\"answer\":\"Beyond listings, Settlin helps you evaluate live inventory in Raj Residency with better context on pricing, documentation, project fit, and transaction support, making the process more guided and efficient.\",\"category\":\"project_page\",\"order\":14,\"showOnHomepage\":false,\"homepageDisplayOrder\":0},{\"question\":\"Is there zero brokerage on homes in Raj Residency listed by Settlin?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. If a home in Raj Residency is listed through Settlin, the buyer does not pay brokerage to Settlin on successful purchase. Government charges and any other transaction-linked costs still apply separately.\",\"category\":\"project_page\",\"order\":15,\"showOnHomepage\":false,\"homepageDisplayOrder\":0},{\"question\":\"Do I need to pay anything upfront to buy in Raj Residency through Settlin?\",\"answer\":\"No upfront payment is required to explore inventory, evaluate options, or move forward with discovery through Settlin in Raj Residency. If you proceed with a listed property, you may have to hold the property via a fully refundable advance amount. But the brokerage remains absolutely zero, while statutory purchase costs still apply.\",\"category\":\"project_page\",\"order\":16,\"showOnHomepage\":false,\"homepageDisplayOrder\":0},{\"question\":\"How does Settlin verify homes in Raj Residency?\",\"answer\":\"Settlin helps buyers in Raj Residency by coordinating checks around key title documents, approvals, ownership records, and transaction paperwork. Buyers should still review the exact unit-level documentation before closing the purchase.\",\"category\":\"project_page\",\"order\":17,\"showOnHomepage\":false,\"homepageDisplayOrder\":0},{\"question\":\"Is Settlin RERA registered and can it support purchases in Raj Residency?\",\"answer\":\"Yes. Settlin is RERA registered and can support buyers considering homes in Raj Residency with guided discovery, legal-document coordination, loan assistance, and end-to-end transaction support.\",\"category\":\"project_page\",\"order\":18,\"showOnHomepage\":false,\"homepageDisplayOrder\":0}],\"className\":\"mt-4 md:mt-6\"}]\n"])</script><script type="bd221258673ae7223689147b-text/javascript">self.__next